# Text files are stored and checked out with LF on every platform: tests read repository files
# byte for byte, and a Windows checkout with core.autocrlf would otherwise turn them into CRLF.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.gif binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.ico binary
*.vsix binary
*.tgz binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.pdf binary
